> dblneg_A(a: bool) = a
> dblneg_B(a: bool) = !!a
> equiv dblneg_A ~ dblneg_B
dblneg_A and dblneg_B are equal on the domain of dblneg_A (exhaustive)
> xor0_A(a: bool) = a
> xor0_B(a: bool) = a xor 0
> equiv xor0_A ~ xor0_B
xor0_A and xor0_B are equal on the domain of xor0_A (exhaustive)
> xor1_A(a: bool) = !a
> xor1_B(a: bool) = a xor 1
> equiv xor1_A ~ xor1_B
xor1_A and xor1_B are equal on the domain of xor1_A (exhaustive)
> xorself_A(a: bool) = 0
> xorself_B(a: bool) = a xor a
> equiv xorself_A ~ xorself_B
xorself_A and xorself_B are equal on the domain of xorself_A (exhaustive)
> xor_or_and_A(a: bool, b: bool) = a xor b
> xor_or_and_B(a: bool, b: bool) = (a | b) & !(a & b)
> equiv xor_or_and_A ~ xor_or_and_B
xor_or_and_A and xor_or_and_B are equal on the domain of xor_or_and_A (exhaustive)
> xor_comm_A(a: bool, b: bool) = a xor b
> xor_comm_B(a: bool, b: bool) = b xor a
> equiv xor_comm_A ~ xor_comm_B
xor_comm_A and xor_comm_B are equal on the domain of xor_comm_A (exhaustive)
> xor_assoc_A(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (a xor b) xor c
> xor_assoc_B(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = a xor (b xor c)
> equiv xor_assoc_A ~ xor_assoc_B
xor_assoc_A and xor_assoc_B are equal on the domain of xor_assoc_A (exhaustive)
> xor_distrib_A(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = a & (b xor c)
> xor_distrib_B(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (a & b) xor (a & c)
> equiv xor_distrib_A ~ xor_distrib_B
xor_distrib_A and xor_distrib_B are equal on the domain of xor_distrib_A (exhaustive)
